    "kick membrane modes include bounded strike-dependent tension relaxation instead of a single pitch-swept oscillator",
    "snare combines membrane/body modes with deterministic stochastic wire collisions",
    "closed hi-hat uses velocity-sensitive inharmonic modal decay with bounded strike variation"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "compact real-time approximation, not a fitted or sampled named drum kit",
